dy. Konsekuensi dari putusan tersebut, Teddy kini dinyatakan sah sebagai salah satu ahli waris dari Lina Jubaedah. Perubahan status hukum ini menempatkan Teddy dalam barisan pihak yang berhak atas harta peninggalan mendiang. © KapanLa ©KapanLagi.com/BudySantoso panLagi.com/Budy com/Budy Santoso K\".", "has_audio": null, "image_versions2": {"candidates": [{"url": "https://instagram.fcgk6-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/759699086_1483962987091963_2815496603260991720_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=107&ig_cache_key=Mzk1MTAzODQzNDU3MTg4MjAyMA%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNBUk9VU0VMX0lURU0ueHBpZHMuMTA4MC5zZHIucmVndWxhcl9waG90by5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=FO2iF3FZzjsQ7kNvwFUycys&_nc_oc=AdqxIxGARldZvKOO8LRhCaTxAxbV9W9rou9CYwmnFMHSYgECwFmMTinGD-xPgQ3wRV8&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.fcgk6-2.fna&_nc_gid=EVVdbtwiD46gx2oB7ctBvw&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQE9VbsPf1F8IdKklw2Pni1-RZ99qeeuDEu62L4NvXrIIg&oe=6A74F6FB", "height": 1350, "width": 1080}, {"url": "https://instagram.fcgk6-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/759699086_1483962987091963_2815496603260991720_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p720x720_tt6&_nc_cat=107&ig_cache_key=Mzk1MTAzODQzNDU3MTg4MjAyMA%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNBUk9VU0VMX0lURU0ueHBpZHMuMTA4MC5zZHIucmVndWxhcl9waG90by5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=FO2iF3FZzjsQ7kNvwFUycys&_nc_oc=AdqxIxGARldZvKOO8LRhCaTxAxbV9W9rou9CYwmnFMHSYgECwFmMTinGD-xPgQ3wRV8&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.fcgk6-2.fna&_nc_gid=EVVdbtwiD46gx2oB7ctBvw&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQGaYxQ0wJ6WU_OcWT2sOTKM8VVumsrJWlQrT8ZzwDqY_g&oe=6A74F6FB", "height": 900, "width": 720}, {"url": "https://instagram.fcgk6-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/759699086_1483962987091963_2815496603260991720_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p640x640_sh2.08_tt6&_nc_cat=107&ig_cache_key=Mzk1MTAzODQzNDU3MTg4MjAyMA%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNBUk9VU0VMX0lURU0ueHBpZHMuMTA4MC5zZHIucmVndWxhcl9waG90by5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=FO2iF3FZzjsQ7kNvwFUycys&_nc_oc=AdqxIxGARldZvKOO